  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 49981677568
    m_Localized: Contract.ssil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50011037696
    m_Localized: Exclusive Editor Employment Agreement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50011037697
    m_Localized: Exclusive Editor Employment Agreement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50015232000
    m_Localized: "The Setup Wizard will guide you through the steps required to sign
      the Exclusive Editor Employment Agreement. \n\nClick Next to proceed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50015232001
    m_Localized: Please read the license terms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50015232002
    m_Localized: "EXCLUSIVE EDITOR EMPLOYMENT AGREEMENT\n\nAGREEMENT, effective between
      the Holy Warrior (the \u201CEmployer\u201D) and the editor (the \u201CEmployee\u201D).\n\nWHEREAS,
      the Employer desires to employ the Employee, and the Employee desires to accept
      such employment upon the terms and subject to the conditions contained herein.\n\nNOW,
      THEREFORE, in consideration of the foregoing and of the mutual covenants and
      obligations hereinafter contained, the parties hereto, intending to be legally
      bound, hereby agree as follows:\n\n1. Term of Employment.\nSubject to the terms
      and  conditions  of this  Agreement,  the Employer hereby  employs the  Employee 
      for the Term (as  hereinafter  defined),  as the Exclusive Editor of the Employer
      subject to termination pursuant to Section 6 hereof. The period commencing
      on the date the Employee returns the executed Agreement through the date of
      such termination shall be the \"Term of Employment\".\n\n2. Duties and Extent
      of Services.\nDuring the Term of Employment, the Employee shall serve as the
      editor of video files in which the Employer shall convey to the Employee to
      post on the Employer\u2019s Wtube channel, and, in such capacity, shall render
      such editorial services, such as delivering the video files within the timeframe
      specified by the Employer, as are customarily associated with and incident
      to such position, and as the Employer may, from time to time, reasonably require
      of them consistent with such position. The Employee\u2019s primary place of
      work shall be their residence, and the Employee shall not be required to provide
      daily notification of their work status to the Employer; provided, however,
      that upon the Employer\u2019s request, the Employee shall provide evidence
      of work performed, which may include, but is not limited to, the execution
      logs of Manasoft Worlds Movie Weaver and the creation or modification dates
      of the edited video files.\u2026\n\nFor further details regarding this agreement,
      click here to refer to the official Manasoft website.\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50015232003
    m_Localized: Yes, I accept the license terms and conditions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50015232004
    m_Localized: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50015232005
    m_Localized: "You have successfully signed the agreement. \nManasoft supports
      your continued growth.\n\nYou are now eligible to install NA1L, our video editing
      assistant provided by Manasoft as part of your agreement."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50015232006
    m_Localized: "Yes, I want to install \nour video editing assistant, NA1L. (Tutorial)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50015232007
    m_Localized: No, do not install.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50015232008
    m_Localized: 'Next '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50015232009
    m_Localized: "WARNING\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50015232010
    m_Localized: "If you choose not to install our video editing assistant, NA1L,
      provided by Manasoft, you will not be able to access the tutorial. \n\nDo you
      wish to proceed without installing NA1L and skip the tutorial?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50015232011
    m_Localized: Skip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50015232012
    m_Localized: Install
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50015232013
    m_Localized: NA1L v.2.2.9 Setup Wizard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50019426304
    m_Localized: "SOFTWARE SUPPLEMENTAL LICENSE TERMS\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50019426305
    m_Localized: "Manasoft (or based on where you live, one of its affiliates) licenses
      this supplement to you. \n\nIf you are licensed to use Exclusive Editor Employment
      Agreement, Exclusive Bard Employment Agreement, Exclusive Pirate Employment
      Agreement (for which this supplement is applicable) (the \u201Cagreement\u201D),
      you may use this supplement. You may not use it if you do not have a license
      for the agreement. Manasoft provides support services for this supplement as
      described at the official Manasoft website. \n\nThis supplement supports an
      authorized user\u2019s access to the tutorial through the Manasoft Worlds Movie
      Weaver Application Program (the \u201Cprogram\u201D) for Worlds, a companion
      for the agreement which the user must separately install and license. \n\nBy
      installing, copying, downloading, accessing, or otherwise using this supplement,
      you accept these terms.\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50019426306
    m_Localized: Yes, I accept the license terms and conditions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50019426307
    m_Localized: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50019426308
    m_Localized: "Setup has finished installing NA1L v.2.2.9 on your computer. \n\nClick
      Finish to exit Setup."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50019426309
    m_Localized: Finish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4569923051520
    m_Localized: NA1L v.2.2.9 Installing...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2438075949244416
    m_Localized: "EXCLUSIVE EDITOR EMPLOYMENT AGREEMENT\n\nAGREEMENT, effective between
      the Holy Warrior (the \u201CEmployer\u201D) and the editor (the \u201CEmployee\u201D).\n\nWHEREAS,
      the Employer desires to employ the Employee, and the Employee desires to accept
      such employment upon the terms and subject to the conditions contained herein.\n\nNOW,
      THEREFORE, in consideration of the foregoing and of the mutual covenants and
      obligations hereinafter contained, the parties hereto, intending to be legally
      bound, hereby agree as follows:\n\n1. Term of Employment.\nSubject to the terms
      and conditions of this Agreement, the Employer hereby employs the Employee
      for the Term (as hereinafter defined), as the Exclusive Editor of the Employer
      subject to termination pursuant to Section 6 hereof. The period commencing
      on the date the Employee returns the executed Agreement through the date on
      which the Employer ceases to maintain its business operations or the date on
      which the Employee becomes unable to provide labor, whichever comes first,
      shall be the \"\"Term of Employment\"\".\n\n2. Duties and Extent of Services.\nDuring
      the Term of Employment, the Employee shall serve as the editor of video files
      in which the Employer shall convey to the Employee to post on the Employer\u2019s
      Wtube channel, and, in such capacity, shall render such editorial services,
      such as delivering the video files within the timeframe specified by the Employer,
      as are customarily associated with and incident to such position, and as the
      Employer may, from time to time, reasonably require of them consistent with
      such position. The Employee\u2019s primary place of work shall be their residence,
      and the Employee shall not be required to provide daily notification of their
      work status to the Employer; provided, however, that upon the Employer\u2019s
      request, the Employee shall provide evidence of work performed, which may include,
      but is not limited to, the execution logs of Manasoft Worlds Movie Weaver and
      the creation or modification dates of the edited video files.\u2026\n\nFor
      further details regarding this agreement, click here to refer to the official
      Manasoft website.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2438367688253440
    m_Localized: "\"You have successfully signed the agreement. \nManasoft supports
      your continued growth.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
